TYPES.md §15, EVALUATION.md §3.2, DECISIONS 187: a const whose value builds a record whose default reads the const is a cycle between values, found at type-checking time: E4301 at the use closing it.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// K.
const K = (T {}).a

/// T.
record T {
  /// a.
  a: Int = K
}
-- findings.txt --
error[E4301]  a/a.canon:9:12
  K: cycle between values: K -> K

